    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pure sandbox where you design pixel-art maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810480/extras/c8adb0f584bf3512205399ec246cc125.poster.avif?t=1752407415\" aria-label=\"Place some tiles, like rails &amp; bareers, and they automatically adjust to other tiles like them around.\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810480/extras/c8adb0f584bf3512205399ec246cc125.webm?t=1752407415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810480/extras/c8adb0f584bf3512205399ec246cc125.mp4?t=1752407415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create infinite worlds: maps have no limits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810480/extras/7684aa302b066b8edff1a290a83ca609.poster.avif?t=1752407415\" aria-label=\"You can unzoom and make maps as big as your laptop can.\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810480/extras/7684aa302b066b8edff1a290a83ca609.webm?t=1752407415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810480/extras/7684aa302b066b8edff1a290a83ca609.mp4?t=1752407415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chill game with no mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810480/extras/e663855fc2d65784a4a699f1d780614d.poster.avif?t=1752407415\" aria-label=\"Make a smiley face with water.\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810480/extras/e663855fc2d65784a4a699f1d780614d.webm?t=1752407415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810480/extras/e663855fc2d65784a4a699f1d780614d.mp4?t=1752407415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make UI invisible to take screenshots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810480/extras/f48b6bb0917dcb0f6f986d35b79b4503.poster.avif?t=1752407415\" aria-label=\"Toggle UI button to make UI invisible.\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810480/extras/f48b6bb0917dcb0f6f986d35b79b4503.webm?t=1752407415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810480/extras/f48b6bb0917dcb0f6f986d35b79b4503.mp4?t=1752407415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No money, no problems! There are no currency, no management, no rewards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For bugs, feedback, suggestions: <a href=\"mailto:retro.meadow.zegame@gmail.com\">retro.meadow.zegame@gmail.com</a></p>",
